==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''43 Million Downloads'''}} for The Battle Cats!<br>
The Cat Army just can't be stopped!!!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Login between May 6th (11:00am) and May 20th (11:00am) to join in on the party!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● 43 Million Downloads Special Stages!'''}}<br>
Visit Stories of Legend/Event Stages during this event period to take on {{Color|#FF0000|'''Deadly Carnival'''}} or {{Color|#FF0000|'''Celebration'''}} stages!<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・"Deadly Carnival" 1, 2, & 3!'''}}<br>
The toughest test is here... can you stand the heat?<br>
See if YOU are up to the challenge of these Deadly-grade stages, including the final test {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Deadly Carnival 3'''}}!<br>
Clear the first stage for a reward of 3 Normal Tickets, then clear the second stage for a Rare Ticket prize!<br>
Don't miss out on this awesome chance for tickets!<br>
<small><small>※If this event does not appear, please update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats and reboot the app.<br>
※Rewards will only be received upon the first stage clear. Players who have previously cleared these stages will not be able to collect the rewards.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● XP Festival Events!'''}}<br>
Get ready to power up your Cats to the max with the special stages {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Blitz XP, XP Megablitz, XP Colosseum, and Merciless XP'''}} at Legend Stages!

{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''● Blitz XP Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Odd Dates (May 7, 9, 11, 13, 15, 17, 19): 11:00 AM ~ 2:00 PM'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Even Dates (May 6, 8, 10, 12, 14, 16, 18): 7:00 PM ~ 10:00 PM'''}}

{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''● XP Megablitz Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Odd Dates (May 7, 9, 11, 13, 15, 17, 19):'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Even Dates (May 6, 8, 10, 12, 14, 16, 18):'''}}
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・XP Colosseum Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''5/8, 5/11, 5/14, 5/17, 5/20:'''}} 8:00 AM ~ 9:00 AM<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''5/6, 5/9, 5/12, 5/15, 5/18:'''}} 4:00 PM ~ 5:00 PM<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''5/7, 5/10, 5/13, 5/16, 5/19:'''}} 10:00 PM ~ 11:00 PM
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Merciless XP! Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''5/8, 5/11, 5/14, 5/17:'''}} 4:00 PM ~ 5:00 PM<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''5/6, 5/9, 5/12, 5/15, 5/18:'''}} 10:00 PM ~ 11:00 PM<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''5/7, 5/10, 5/13, 5/16, 5/19:'''}} 8:00 AM ~ 9:00 AM
Don't miss out on this chance!<br>
<small><small>※Regularly occurring XP events will also be be available outside of the times listed above.<br>
※ XP Megablitz is available after Empire of Cats Ch. 3 is cleared. XP Colosseum becomes available after Into the Future Ch. 1 is cleared.<br>
※If this event does not appear, please update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats and reboot the app.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Builder's Blitz!'''}}<br>
Build up your Cat Base with the Ototo Corps by collecting materials at these special stages!<br>
Get building materials at the Special Stages {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Cavern of Comets, Island of Ash, Strait of Wings'''}}, appearing at the times below!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''7:00am ～ 8:59am / 12:00pm ～ 1:59pm / 6:00pm ～ 7:59pm / 10:00pm ～ 11:59pm'''}}<br>
Take on these challenges each day and build up your building stockpiles!<br>
<small><small>※These stages will become available once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared.<br>
※ The Cavern of Comets, Strait of Wings, and Island of Ash stages will appear at regularly scheduled times in addition to the special campaign times listed above.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Treasure Festivals!'''}}<br>
During this event, get {{Color|#FF6600|'''increased Treasure Drop Rates'''}} in Story Mode chapters for a special {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Treasure Festival'''}}, all day every day!<br>
On {{Color|#008000|'''even days (5/6, 5/8, 5/10, 5/12, 5/14, 5/16, 5/18, 5/20)'''}} visit {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, and on {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''odd days (5/7, 5/9, 5/11, 5/13, 5/15, 5/17, 5/19)'''}} head to {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Into the Future'''}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} on {{Color|#335599|'''5/8, 5/11, 5/14, 5/16 and 5/19'''}}!<br>
※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Limited GAMATOTO Expedition Areas'''}}<br>
Only during this event, you can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the limited areas {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Cats Eye Cave'''}} and {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''XP Harvest'''}} for a special set of Cats Eye rewards!<br>
Get as many Cats Eyes and XP as you can and help your units break through to even higher levels!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Cats Eye Cave:'''}} May 6th (11am) thru May 13th (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・XP Harvest:'''}} May 13th (11am) thru 20th (10:59am)<br>
Don't miss this special chance!

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Catfruit / Catseye Limited Capsule Events!'''}}<br>
At the Capsule Menu, tap the buttons at top left to switch between standard Capsule events and the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catfruit Limited Capsules'''}} & {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catfruit Limited Capsules'''}}!<br>
Power up your Cats! Don't miss out on these cool items!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Catfruit Capsules'''}}<br>
May 6th (11:00am) through May 13th (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Catseye Capsules'''}}<br>
May 13th (11:00am) through May 20th (2:59pm)<br>
<small><small>※The Catfruit Limited Capsules provide Catfruit and XP rewards, while Catseye Limited Capsules will provide Catseyes and XP!<br>
※Catfruit Limited Capsules will appear after Empire of Cats Ch. 3 is completed in The Battle Cats, and Catseye Limited Capsules will appear in the Cat Capsules once User Rank 1600 is cleared.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Cat Food presents every day!'''}}<br>
Visit the Battle Cats app to collect a reward of {{Color|#FF00FF|'''20 Cat Food'''}} each day of the campaign! Check in and profit!

